The stock vars.xml resolves external_rtp_ip and external_sip_ip with a live
STUN query at config-load time, which on a CI network with no outbound UDP/3478
either stalls the boot for the timeout or resolves to nothing useful — and then
it looks like the server is slow to listen, which gets blamed on the client's
retry logic. Fixing both to the container's own address removes the question.
-->
<include>
  <X-PRE-PROCESS cmd="set" data="external_rtp_ip=$${local_ip_v4}"/>
  <X-PRE-PROCESS cmd="set" data="external_sip_ip=$${local_ip_v4}"/>
</include>
